</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>The NMSE values during the search process of our method and LLM-SR.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Sx4.F7" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
